        <item>
    <title>[C/CPP] 宏技巧收集</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/cpp_macro_usage/</link>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 05:07:25 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/cpp_macro_usage/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="防止重定义">防止重定义</h1>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-c">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// 以本文件定义为准，解除CDBG防止编译器重复定义报错
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#undef CDBG
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#ifdef ENABLE_XXX
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">	<span class="cp">#define CDBG printk
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#else
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">	<span class="cp">#define CDBG
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#endif </span><span class="cm">/* ENABLE_XXX */</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h1 id="宏重言智能枚举">宏重言（智能枚举）</h1>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-c">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#ifdef SPECIAL_ENUM_META
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// auxiliary macros for CONCAT
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#define _CONCAT(x,y) x##y
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#define CONCAT(x,y)	_CONCAT(x,y)
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#define LABEL_CONNAME   CONCAT(label_,SPECIAL_ENUM_NAME)
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#define ENUM_CONNAME   CONCAT(enum_,SPECIAL_ENUM_NAME)
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// ENUM_TO
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#define ENUM_TO_STR(x)  LABEL_CONNAME[x]
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// create info
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#ifdef MAKE_INSTANCE    </span><span class="c1">// const char &amp; 
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">const</span> <span class="kt">char</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">LABEL_CONNAME</span><span class="p">[]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="cp">#define SPECIAL_ENUM(x) #x
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">SPECIAL_ENUM_META</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="cp">#undef SPECIAL_ENUM
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">};</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#else
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">extern</span> <span class="k">const</span> <span class="kt">char</span><span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">LABEL_CONNAME</span><span class="p">[];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#endif
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// create enum, AS IS mode
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">enum</span> <span class="n">ENUM_CONNAME</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="cp">#define SPECIAL_ENUM(x) x
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">SPECIAL_ENUM_META</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="cp">#undef SPECIAL_ENUM
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">};</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#undef SPECIAL_ENUM_META
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="cp">#endif</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>Linux 内核架构观察：功能体（cdev）与实体（Device）的分立</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_09_cdev_sep_dev/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 10:15:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_09_cdev_sep_dev/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="核心论点">核心论点</h3>
<p>在 Linux 设备模型中，驱动程序并不是一个不可分割的整体，而是**功能策略（Functionality）<strong>与</strong>物理实体（Entity）**的强行耦合。</p>
<h3 id="1-cdev卑微的会计与策略表">1. cdev：卑微的“会计”与策略表</h3>
<p><strong>cdev (Character Device)</strong> 并不在内核的硬件拓扑树中占有一席之地。它的本质是一个<strong>策略映射器</strong>。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>[AI总结] 用户态并发原理: 从指令到契约（修订版）</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_08_futex_libc/</link>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 11:15:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_08_futex_libc/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>在 Linux 用户态开发中，<code>std::thread</code> 或 <code>pthread</code> 往往被视为并发的起点。但剥开库的包装，你会发现：<strong>用户态没有独立的并发物理权。</strong></p>
<p>所有的同步原语，本质上都是从内核 UAPI 中“借”出来的执行策略。而 <code>pthread</code>，则是这套借贷契约的标准化搬运工。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>[AI总结] 用户态并发原理：从 Futex规则 到 std::thread 的性能审计</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_07_futex_pthread/</link>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 10:45:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_07_futex_pthread/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>在 C++ 或 C 语言中调用 <code>std::thread</code> 或 <code>pthread_create</code> 时，我们往往产生一种幻觉：我们在直接操控 CPU 的并发。</p>
<p>但剥开层层包装，你会发现：<strong>用户态没有真正的并发原语。</strong> 所有的“体面”都是向内核借来的，而这张借条的名字，叫作 <strong>Futex (Fast Userspace Mutex)</strong>。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>[AI总结] 用户态并发原理: 从指令到契约</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_06_smp/</link>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 02:13:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/linux_subsystem_06_smp/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>在现代多核（SMP）架构下，编写并发代码本质上是在处理一场<strong>由物理电信号驱动的“绩效狂欢”</strong>。当我们剥开 <code>mutex_lock</code> 的华丽外衣，最深处只有那几行冷酷的 <code>ldrex/strex</code>。</p>
<p>本文旨在将 Linux 内核的并发体系按“细粒度”与“上下文”进行垂直排布，揭示从<strong>物理重试</strong>到<strong>逻辑认怂</strong>的完整链路。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>[AI总结] 模块化 IP 的具象：AP&#43;BP 架构、奢侈的基带</title>
    <link>http://example.org/posts/ap_bp_brief_intro/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>lazurite</author>
    <guid>http://example.org/posts/ap_bp_brief_intro/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="0-前言算力倒挂的工业荒诞">0. 前言：算力倒挂的工业荒诞</h2>
<p>在嵌入式开发中，我们常陷入一种“主从错觉”：认为主控 CPU（AP）是核心，而通讯模块（BP）只是个外设。但当你拆开屏蔽罩，看到 <strong>1.2GHz 的 MDM9x07</strong> 甚至 <strong>四核 MSM8612</strong> 仅仅是在通过串口为 <strong>528MHz 的 i.MX6ULL</strong> 传递几行 AT 指令时，一种工业级的讽刺感油然而生。</p>]]></description>
</item>
